&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a bilingual Spanish field sales opportunity based out of a personal home office. You must live local to your territory in East Houston, TX &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;or be willing to relocate to the area.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
