&lt;p&gt;Toast is driven by building the restaurant platform that helps restaurants adapt, take control, and get back to what they do best: building the businesses they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a District Sales Manager, you are pivotal to the growth of the Toast brand in your district. You will report into a Regional Vice President and will hire, build, and coach a team of Field Account Executives who everyday transform the way restaurants operate. You&#39;ll be hands on working closely with your sales team to help them understand a restaurant’s unique needs and develop a customized solution that helps their business thrive. We need your passion and sales management expertise to help us build the Toast brand in your district.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role managing a Vancouver-based field sales team. It involves a mix of working from the field, home, and the office.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life (Responsibilities)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop, motivate, and manage a quota-achieving field sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach your team on how to conduct efficient discovery meetings, live demos, and craft a solution that best meets the prospective customer’s needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend time enabling and empowering your team through walk-ins, prospecting, trade shows, and local business partnerships to help exceed quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and collaborate with peers and parallel teams across the business to ensure that expectations set during the sales process are met in delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically utilize Salesforce (our CRM) and other technology to drive productivity, report on forecast deal pipelines, and analyse conversion rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the new business growth across your assigned district&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you have the right ingredients*? (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
