&lt;li&gt;Advanced experience with sharing, security, visibility, data models, Flows and other Salesforce platform features &amp;amp; components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce Sales Cloud or Service Cloud.(Experience Cloud a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce CPQ configuration and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Salesforce CPQ Products, Features, Options, Configuration Attributes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce CPQ Product Rules, Pricing Rules, Lookup Queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce Discounting, contracts, quote templates, and renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the Quote to Cash Domain (preferably CPQ (Salesforce CPQ/Conga/Industry CPQ)&amp;nbsp; and/or Billing (Zuora/Salesforce Billing/Conga Billing))&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leading the team of developers for the delivery of the projects/features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of the Software Development Life cycle and Agile methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and decision-making skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and support other team members as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Platform Developer I &amp;amp; II certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce CPQ certification a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in stakeholder management and should be able to communicate effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt and learn quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering / Equivalent educational background a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates required to work in hybrid mode with 3 days work from office in a week .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus ingredients* (a pinch of salt): (Non-essential skills)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using ServiceNow or similar tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Jira or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using version control tools (GitHub)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Salesforce CI/CD tools - Copado etc&lt;/li&gt;
