&lt;p&gt;Toast creates technology to help restaurants and local businesses succeed in a digital world, helping business owners operate, increase sales, engage customers, and keep employees happy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond point-of-sale and digital ordering, Toast offers financial solutions, including Toast Capital, that help restaurants access the funding they need to grow.&amp;nbsp;We are building a new Embedded Finance Operations footprint in Bengaluru, and we&#39;re looking for the leader who will build it. This role is an extended arm of Toast&#39;s US Embedded Finance Operations team (40+ people) and is critical as we expand our footprint and international strategy. The role sits within the Embedded Finance Operations organization and partners closely with the US-based underwriting team and its leaders. As Manager of Embedded Finance, you will set up and lead a high-performing underwriting function from the ground up, working closely with Product, Engineering, and Risk partners in Bengaluru and with your leadership in the US.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a player-coach role. You&#39;ll understand the lending business deeply enough to make and review credit decisions yourself, while building the team, processes, and tooling that let the function scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The scope is big. This team sits at the center of how Toast uses automation, data, and AI to change how lending operations work. If you&#39;re a lending operations leader who loves building something new, brings an automation and analytics mindset, and can lead people through change, read on!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life (Responsibilities)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the underwriting function from the ground up.&lt;/strong&gt; Stand up Toast&#39;s Embedded Finance Operations presence in Bengaluru: define the operating model, workflows, quality standards, SLAs, and controls for a high-performing underwriting team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead as a player-coach.&lt;/strong&gt; Manage a team of underwriters directly and few team members on a dotted line. Stay hands-on with underwriting decisions, case reviews, and escalations while coaching the team to consistent, high-quality outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hire and grow the team.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner on annual planning to shape headcount and capacity needs, then recruit, onboard, and develop talent as the team expands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive automation and AI transformation.&lt;/strong&gt; Find opportunities to automate manual underwriting and operations work, and partner with Product and Engineering to build and roll out AI-enabled tools, decisioning workflows, and self-serve processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make operations data-driven.&lt;/strong&gt; Define the metrics that matter (throughput, turnaround time, decision quality, accuracy) and build the BI dashboards and analytics that track performance, surface risk, and guide decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong cross-functional partnerships.&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the operations voice to Product, Engineering, and Risk stakeholders in Bengaluru. Translate operational insight into product requirements and policy feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work as part of a global team.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the US-based underwriting team and leaders, and with global Embedded Finance counterparts, to align on priorities, policies, and standards across time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through change.&lt;/strong&gt; Guide the team through new processes, tools, and ways of working with clear communication, empathy, and a steady focus on outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain strong risk and compliance discipline.&lt;/strong&gt; Make sure underwriting practices follow credit policy, regulatory expectations, and internal controls, and support audits and reviews as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools in your own workflow and help set how the team uses them well, including how to critically evaluate what they produce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in lending, credit, or financial services operations, with a strong understanding of the lending business and the underwriting lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on underwriting or credit decisioning experience (small business, merchant, or commercial lending preferred), with the judgment to make and review complex credit calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven people leadership experience: you have managed and grown teams, including hiring, coaching, performance management, and building team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling an operations function, ideally in a new market or a new team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong background in process automation, BI, and data analytics. You can work with data directly (e.g., SQL, Excel, Looker, Tableau or similar) and use it to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading teams through change, including adopting new tools, processes, or operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent relationship-building and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence Product, Engineering, and Risk partners without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in global teams and collaborating across time zones, including regular overlap with US-based leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking combined with an execution-focused, roll-up-your-sleeves approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication. You can explain complex operational and credit topics simply to a range of audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI-powered tools to improve productivity and decision-making, with the judgment to validate what they produce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will help you stand out (Nonessential Skills/Nice to Haves)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, embedded finance, or merchant cash advance / small business lending.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing AI or machine-learning-assisted decisioning or workflow automation in an operations setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up a new center of excellence or global capability center in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with credit risk frameworks, fraud prevention, or KYC/KYB processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean, Six Sigma, or other process-improvement experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in restaurant, hospitality, or SMB-focused businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
