&lt;p&gt;Toast creates technology to help restaurants and local businesses succeed in a digital world, helping business owners operate, increase sales, engage customers, and keep employees happy. Toast helps restaurants adapt, take control, and get back to what they do best : building the businesses they love. Toast connects employees, operations, and guests on a reliable, easy-to-use platform so restaurateurs can stay one step ahead of a rapidly evolving hospitality market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring for the &#39;International Payments&#39; team - the driving force behind Toast&#39;s global expansion. We architect and scale the core payment engine powering our growth in new markets around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal-Engineer/Architect, you will spearhead technical strategy and architect scalable designs for Toast’s largest restaurant brands. Partnering with product, business &amp;amp; engineering stakeholders, you will define the technological roadmap empowering customers to unleash the full capability of Toast. You will collaborate with engineering leaders and cross-functional teams across the organization to execute robust, mission-critical solutions seamlessly integrated with external systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will drive the evolution of our International Payments platform, expanding Toast’s global footprint with best-in-class customer-facing Fintech products and foundational capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain deep expertise in Toast’s payments ecosystem to enable reliable, seamless payment acceptance and processing across our fintech portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect resilient, high-scale, mission-critical payment platform components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, deploy, and maintain highly resilient and scalable features across Toast’s International line-of-products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex initiatives that would span multiple teams &amp;amp; systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders across the organization - including PMs, SEs, QA, and UX - to help your teams get stuff done and deliver solutions that maximize value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive high-quality team output and ensure that the team makes solid technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a steward of an exceptional culture, encompassing both technical excellence and people‑centric values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion best practices for SDLC &amp;amp; CICD life-cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the use of AI tools and practices to accelerate development, improve team velocity, and pioneer new ways of building - setting the bar for what it means to be an AI-first engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor &amp;amp; coach engineers within the Fintech organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and develop new team members, helping build a diverse team that wins together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technologist with 12+ years experience defining and implementing high scale SaaS solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong understanding &amp;amp; hands-on experience of building fault-tolerant, highly-scalable &amp;amp; secure distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with sql/nosql databases, strong understanding of distributed datastores and knowledge of when to use what.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundations in data structures &amp;amp; algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and a proven track record of building partnerships across engineering, product, customer success, and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping iterative value using agile or lean software delivery methods.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of tackling complex and ambiguous problems, communicate clearly with others to solve the problem, and share knowledge to help the whole team succeed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building payments &amp;amp; Fintech products, with at least 10+ years in the payments industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend services which follow a microservice architecture written using Kotlin, Java and DropWizard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event driven messaging &amp;amp; streaming using Apache Pulsar &amp;amp; RabbitMQ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apache Camel for implementing Enterprise Integration Pattern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React &amp;amp; ES6 based Frontend SPAs leveraging Tailwind, GraphQL and Storybook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DynamoDb &amp;amp; Postgres as core persistence data-storage layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Datadog &amp;amp; Sentry for system and application metric and monitoring.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Splunk for log aggregation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FireHydrant for alerting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
