&lt;p&gt;Toast creates technology to help restaurants and local businesses succeed in a digital world, helping business owners operate, increase sales, engage customers, and keep employees happy. We help restaurants streamline operations, increase revenue, and deliver amazing guest experiences through our platform that combines restaurant point of sale, team management, guest-facing technology, and award-winning customer support. As a Toaster, you will be challenged to take on meaningful projects to help craft the company&#39;s future. Join us as we empower the restaurant community to delight guests, do what they love, and thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to lead the architectural design, technical execution, and implementation across the foundational domains of Toast’s Team Suite products, Payroll and Team Management. The Payroll product delivers daily value to its users - enabling restaurant owners to pay their staff and pay their taxes, and enabling transparency for wages and tips for restaurant employees.&amp;nbsp; The Team Management suite allows restaurants to hire, manage, and schedule their staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Engineer, you will serve as a key technical leader in the group, driving modern architectural patterns—including spec-driven development and agentic workflows—to deliver high-impact software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead fellow developers, product managers, designers, and user researchers to build a strong tech infrastructure that enables amazing features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture for authentication, authorization, and organizational hierarchy — driving technical direction in these domains across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help us transform a traditional SasS platform into an agentic, system-of-action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flex your full-stack muscles by driving challenging large end-to-end initiatives or core architecture changes in a supportive, collaborative team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive technical strategy for problems that affect multiple parts of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor developers across multiple teams through code-pairing and detailed code, architecture, and project reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion best practices for development, deployment and quality life cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage cutting edge AI tools to enhance your development workflow, improve velocity, and help pioneer new approaches to building - contributing to a culture of innovation and productivity across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
