&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technologist with extensive experience defining and implementing high scale SaaS solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with identity and access architecture — authentication, permissions models, and multi-entity organizational hierarchy — in a multi-tenant SaaS platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a broad set of technologies that includes those used at Toast - tiered web applications, microservices, mobile, API design patterns, Java, Kotlin, React, data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong enthusiasm for agentic development practices, LLM integration, and modern software paradigms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with integration design patterns across high-scale, data-rich enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
