&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bready&lt;/em&gt;* to make a change?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast is looking for a Senior Software Engineer to build innovative solutions on the web to expand how guests interact with our consumer-facing digital dining product, Toast Local. You’ll join a team of frontend, backend, and native mobile engineers working together to create the best digital restaurant experience for guests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Consumer team at Toast is all about creating exceptional consumer experiences for restaurants and their guests. We’re product-obsessed, focused on innovation, and committed to building scalable, reliable solutions that are used by millions of restaurant-goers every day. If you’re ready to make an impact on a massive scale, this is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this &lt;em&gt;roll&lt;/em&gt;* (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team’s work on the web, from guest-facing features to the restaurant tools that support them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cross-platform experiences alongside iOS, Android, and backend engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work across the stack&lt;/strong&gt;, from React and Next.js on the front end to the services behind it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment directly with guests and restaurants to test new dining experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship code that drives the growth and strategy of Toast’s consumer business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you have the right &lt;em&gt;ingredients&lt;/em&gt;*? (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
