&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with managing AWS/Cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building CI/CD solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
