&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for engineers to help make our product work for our largest customers. Think large grocery stores and your favorite local convenience store chain. With their larger scale bring additional needs for integrations and backoffice tools, beyond what the platform offers today. This team works closely with customers&amp;nbsp; — expect to visit stores and talk directly with operators to deeply understand their workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this roll* (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering and product leads to identify high-impact opportunities in the domain&lt;/li&gt;
