&lt;li&gt;Stay in tune with customer needs by hearing direct customer feedback and staying abreast of industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy AI-native experiences that delight our customers, powered by Toast IQ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
