&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience building and shipping production software to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Kotlin&lt;/strong&gt;, or other object oriented programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
