&lt;p&gt;Toast creates technology to help restaurants and local businesses succeed in a digital world, helping business owners operate, increase sales, engage customers, and keep employees happy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast is looking for a hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join the &lt;strong&gt;GTM &amp;amp; AI Strategy &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you will be a primary builder of 0-to-1 tools designed to&amp;nbsp;revolutionize how our sales teams operate. This isn&#39;t about maintaining legacy systems; it’s&amp;nbsp;about writing the code and building the intelligence models that eliminate friction across the&amp;nbsp;Go-To-Market stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a technical lead, you will be responsible for building and&amp;nbsp;productionizing agentic workflows and RAG pipelines to automate sales processes. You will&amp;nbsp;integrate AI services into the tech stack while maintaining rigorous standards for observability&amp;nbsp;and performance monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;
