&lt;li&gt;Join a collaborative team of Design, Product, QA, and other engineering members in developing robust and scalable software within Toast’s POS applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural decisions for correctness, performance, and scale; author and review technical designs within and beyond the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide design feedback and participate in code reviews to ensure implementations meet requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align the technical vision and roadmap for the Orders platform with Toast&#39;s strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a domain expert for order processing and synchronization, and the go-to partner for teams whose products build on orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for best coding practices to raise the bar for you, your team, and the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide technical guidance to other team members and raise the engineering bar across the team and the broader Orders organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
